{'symbol': 'TWTR', 'date': '2022-10-12 21:11:00', 'title': 'TWITTER ALERT: BRAGAR EAGEL & SQUIRE, P.C. ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED AGAINST TWITTER, INC. AND ENCOURAGES INVESTORS TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)-- #ACTION--BRAGAR EAGEL & SQUIRE, P.C.'}{'symbol': 'TWTR', 'date': '2022-10-12 20:08:00', 'title': 'TWITTER SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT PENDING: CONTACT LEVI & KORSINSKY BEFORE NOVEMBER 14, 2022 TO DISCUSS YOUR RIGHTS - TWTR', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - OCTOBER 12, 2022) - LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN TWITTER, INC. (NYSE: TWTR) ("TWITTER" OR THE "COMPANY") OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT.THE LAWSUIT ON BEHALF OF TWITTER INVESTORS HAS BEEN COMMENCED IN THE THE UNITED STATES DISTRICT COURT FOR THE CENTRAL DISTRICT OF CALIFORNIA. AFFECTED INVESTORS PURCHASED OR OTHERWISE ACQUIRED CERTAIN TWITTER, INC. SECURITIES BETWEEN AUGUST 3, 2020 AND AUGUST 23, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'TWTR', 'date': '2022-10-12 12:00:00', 'title': 'TWTR INVESTORS HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD TWITTER, INC. SECURITIES FRAUD LAWSUIT', 'text': 'SHAREHOLDERS WITH $100,000 LOSSES OR MORE ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM. LOS ANGELES , OCT. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE LAW OFFICES OF FRANK R.'}{'symbol': 'TWTR', 'date': '2022-10-12 05:45:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER ALERT: THE GROSS LAW FIRM NOTIFIES SHAREHOLDERS OF TWITTER, INC. OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF NOVEMBER 14, 2022 - (NYSE: TWTR)', 'text': 'NEW YORK , OCT. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE GROSS LAW FIRM ISSUES THE FOLLOWING NOTICE TO SHAREHOLDERS OF TWITTER, INC.. SHAREHOLDERS WHO PURCHASED SHARES OF TWTR DURING THE CLASS PERIOD LISTED ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM REGARDING POSSIBLE LEAD PLAINTIFF APPOINTMENT.'}